        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Big Sandy, Montana; Big Sandy Airport\n- Products: Big Bud 747\n- Organizations: Town of Big Sandy\n- Concepts: population; world's largest farm tractor\n\nFacts:\n- Big Sandy, Montana, had a population of 598 in the 2010 census.\n- Big Bud 747 was located in Big Sandy, Montana, from 1997 until 2009.\n- Big Bud 747 is billed by its owners and exhibitors as the world's largest farm tractor.\n- Big Sandy Airport is owned by the Town of Big Sandy.\n- Big Sandy Airport is located one nautical mile south of Big Sandy's central business district.",
